      "text": "Heat the oven. Heat a large, heavy ovenproof frying pan over medium heat. Season the {chicken} with the {salt} and lay it skin side down. Set a heavy pan on top, weigh it down with a few tins and cook, without moving it, until the skin is deep golden and crisp.",
